<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">Ezra</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia kumpipa Kura kum khatna ah, Jeremiah kam a Toupa thu hihzoh a hihtheihna ding in, Toupa’n Persia kumpipa Kura kha a tokthou a, huchi in a gamsung teng ah thuphuan a bawl a, a gelh in leng a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichibang in Persia kumpipa Kura in a chi, “ Toupa , van Pathian in, Lei gam tengteng kei a honpeta hi; Judah a om Jerusalem a amah inn lamsak ding in kei thu a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mite tengteng na lak ua om peuhmah, a kiang ah Pathian om henla, Judah a om, Jerusalem ah hohtou henla, Toupa Israel Pathian, amah Pathian ahi, Jerusalem a om inn lam hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuapeuh a khualtamna koi munpeuh a nutsiat a omna mun a mite’n, amah dangka leh dangkaeng, vante leh, gantate in panpih uhenla, Jerusalem a om Pathian inn ading a utthu a thillat chihlouh” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Judah leh Benjamin intekpate inkawte lupente, siampute leh Levite, Pathian in Jerusalem a om Toupa inn lam dia hohtou dia a kha uh a tohthohte tengteng, a thouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, a kimvel ua omte tengteng in a khut uh dangka tuium-belsuan, dangkaengte, vante, gantate, leh thil manphate in a hihhat ua, uttak a piakte tengteng simlouh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa Kura in leng Toupa inn a tuium-belsuan, Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem a kipan a lakkhiak, pathian innte a a koihte a lakhe vek hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaite Persia kumpipa Kura in sumkempa Mithredath khut in a lakhe vek a, Judah vaihawm, Sesbazzar pia in a sim sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in hiai a muhzah uh ahi: dangkaeng kuang sawmthum, dangka kuang sang khat, gimlim halna kuang sawmnih leh kua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dangkaeng noubem sawmthum, dangka noubem a hoihlou deuhte za li leh sawmkhat leh tuium-belsuan dangte sang khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dangkaeng leh dangka tuium-belsuan tengteng sang nga leh za li ahi uh. Saltangte lak a te Babulon a kipan Jerusalem a pitouh a omlai un, hiai tengteng Sesbazzar in a tawitou vek hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiaite pimang a om koltanna a kipan a paitou, bial a tate, Babulon lam a a kumpipa Nebukadnezzar in a pimang, Jerusalem leh Judah a, michih amah khua chiat a hongkik nawnte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Relaiah, Mordekai, Bilsan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, Baanah toh hongtonte, Israel mite lak a pasal zah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Parosh suante sang nih za khat sawmsagih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sephatiah suante, za thum sawmsagih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Arah suante, za sagih sawmsagih leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pahath Moab suante, Jeshua leh Joab tate, sang nih za giat leh sawmlehnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elam suante, sang khat za nih sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zattu suante, za kua sawmli leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zakkai suante, za sagih leh sawmguk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bani suante, za guk sawmli leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebai suante, za guk sawmnih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgad suante, sang khat za nih sawmnih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikam suante, za guk sawmguk leh guk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvai suante, sang nih sawmnga leh guk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adin suante, za li sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ater suante, Hezekiah tate, sawmkua leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bezai suante, za thum sawmnih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jorah suante, za khat leh sawmlehnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hasum suante, za nih sawmnih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gibbar suante, sawmkua leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bethlehem suante, za khat sawmnih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Netophath mite, sawmnga leh guk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anathoth mite, za khat sawmnih leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azmaveth suante, sawmli leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kiriath Arim Kephirah, Beeroth suante, za sagih leh sawmli leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ramah leh Geba tate, za guk sawmnih leh khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikmas mite, za khat sawmnih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai mite, za nih sawmnih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebo suante, sawmnga leh guk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Magbish suante, za khat sawmnga leh guk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Elam dang suante, sang khat za nih sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Harim suante, za thum leh sawmnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lod, Hadid leh Ono tate, za sagih sawmnih leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jeriko suante, za thum sawmli leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Senaah suante, sang thum leh za guk leh sawmthum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siampute: Jedaiah suante, Jeshua inkawte, za kua sawmsagih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Immer suante, sang khat sawmnga leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pashur suante, sang khat za nih sawmli leh sagih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Harim suante, sang khat leh sawmlehsagih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Levi mite: Jeshua leh Kadmiel suante, Hodaviah suante, sawmsagih leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lasa mite: Asaph suante, za khat sawmnih leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kongkhak ngak mite: Sallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita leh Sobai suante, avek un za khat sawmthum leh kua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nithunum mite: Ziha, Hasupha leh Tabbaoth suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keros, Siaha leh Padon suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lebanah, Hagabah leh Akkub suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hagab, Samlai leh Hanan suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Giddel, Gahar leh Reaiah suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Rezin, Nekoda leh Gazzam suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Uzza, Paseah leh Besai suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ashna, Meunim leh Nephusim suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bakbuk, Hakupha leh Harhur suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bazluth, Mehida leh Harsa suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Barkos, Sisera leh Thamah suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Neziah leh Hatipha suante,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Solomon sikhate tate: Sotai, Hassopheret leh Peruda suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jaalah, Darkon leh Giddel suante;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Sephatiah, Hattil, Zebaim mi Pokereth leh Ami suante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Nithinim mite teng, Solomon sikhate tate, za thum sawmkua leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Huchi in hiaite Telmelah, Telharsa, Cherub, Addan, leh Immer a kipan a paitoute ahi uh: himahleh a pipute inkawte, a suan uh, Israel a kipan ahi uhia chih a taklang theikei uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Delaiah, Tobiah leh Nekoda suante, za guk sawmnga leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Huan siampute suante: Habaiah, Hakkoz leh Barzillai Gileadmi Barzillai tanute a kipan a zi pipa suante, amau minzui a sak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Hiai khangthusutna a simmite lak a min gelhna a zong ua, himahleh a mu kei uh. Huaiziak in buah a sim in a om ua siamputna a kipan dangkoih in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Huan Tirsatha in, siampu Urim leh Thummim toh a hong dinkhiak mateng, thil siangthou penpente nelou ding in amau a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Omkhawm tengteng avek un sing li sang nih za thum leh sawmguk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />A pasal sikhate uleh a numei sikhate uh, sang sagih za thum sawmlehsagihte simlouh in pasal lasami leh numei lasami sang nih a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A sakolte uh za sagih sawmthum leh guk ahi ua; sakolneute, za nih sawmli leh nga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Sangawngsaute, za li sawmthum leh nga; sabiltung uh, sang guk za sagih leh sawmnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Huan Jerusalem a Toupa inn a hongtun un, a pipute uh inkuan lak a a lupente a khen in, Toupa inn a lamna ding in utthu a thillat a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nasepna sumbawm ah a hihtheih dan un dangkaeng darik sing guk leh sang khat, dangka paund sang nga leh siampute puansilh za khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Huchi in siampute, Levi mite, mite lak a a khenkhat leh lasamite, kongkhak ngakmite leh, Nithinim mite, a khopite uah a teng ua, Israel mite a khopite uah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi a kha sagihna a hongtun a, khopite a Israel tate a omlai un, mite Jerusalem ah mi khat bang in a kikhawm khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Jozadak tapa Jeshua leh, a unaute siampute leh, Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh, a unaute, ading ua, Pathian mi Mosi Dan a a kigelh bang a, a tung a haltum thillatte lan ding in, Israel Pathian maitam a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maitam a kingakna tung ah a tung ua; gamte a mite ziak in a tung uah launa a om hi: huchi in a tung ah Toupa ading in haltum thillatte zing leh nitak a haltum thillatte ngei a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan a kigelh bang in, biakbukte Ankuangluina a bawl ua, a hih ding zah in niteng haltum thillatte, dan dungzui in, niteng a sepding kiphamoh bang in a lan uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai nung in haltum thillat ngeinate, kha thakte thillatte leh, hihsiangthou a om Toupa Ankuanglui sehkhiakte tengteng leh, michih a kipan Toupa adia uttak a utthu a thillatte a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kha sagih a ni khat ni a kipan in Toupa ading in haltum thillatte a lanpan ua: himahleh Toupa biakin suangphum a kiphum naikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sumte suangsekmite kiang leh khutsiammite kiang ah a pia ua; Kura Persia kumpipa a kipan a phalna a muh bang ua tuipi a, Joppa tan a Lebanon tang a kipan sidar singte honla ding in, Zidonte kiang leh, Turate kiang ah, sa, dawn ding, leh sathau a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in a kha nihna, Jerusalem a Pathian inn a hongtun uh a kum nihna in, Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh, Jozadak tapa Jeshua leh, a unaute siampute leh Levi mite leh, koltanna a kipan a Jerusalem a hongpaite a kipan ua; Levimite kum sawmnih a upa leh a tunglam Toupa inn nasepna a heutute hi ding in a sep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian in a nasemmite heutu ding in, Jeshua a tapate leh a unaute, Kadmiel leh a tapate, Judah tapate, Henadad tapate, a tapate uh leh a unaute uh Levi mite toh ading khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn lammite’n Toupa biakin suangphum a koihlai un, Israel kumpipa David thupiak bang in, Toupa phat ding in, siampute pengkulte toh a puan uh a silhsak ua, Levi mite Asaph tapate dakkhutbette a guan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa phatna leh kipahna piakna in la a sakhawm chiat ua, Amah lah a hoih ngal a, a chitna tangtawn in Israel lam ah a om gige ngal a, chi in. Huchi in Toupa inn suangphum a koih ziak un mite tengteng aw ngaihtak a kikou in Toupa a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh siampute leh Levi mite leh pipute inkawte lak a mi tampi, a mit mahmah ua hiai inn suangphum a kikoih lai a, tua inn masa mute putekte, ngaihtak in a kapkhia ua; mi tampi nuamsa in ngaihtak in a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in mite’n nuamsakna kikouna husa mite kahna husa toh a theikak theikei ua: mite ngaihtak in a kikou ua, a husa uh gamlapi ah a kiza hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi a Judah leh Benjamin melmate’n saltangte tate’n Toupa , Israel Pathian ading in biakin a lam uh chih a zak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerubbabel leh, pipute inkaw lupente kiang ah a hongpai nai ua, a kiang uah, “Hon lampih le ung a ke: noute bang in, na Pathian ulah ka zong ngal ua; Assuria kumpipa Esarhaddon in hiai mun a hon pipa damlai nite a kipan amah kiang ah ka kithoih uhi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Zerubbabel leh, Jeshua leh Israel pipu inkaw lupente’n a kiang uah, “Ka Pathian uh adia inn n’on lampihna ding ziak bangmah na neikei uh; himahleh Persia kumpipa Kura in kou thu a honpiak bang in, Israel Pathian, Toupa ading in koute’n ka lam ding uhi,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in gam a mite’n Judah a mite khut a hatsak takei ua, inlamna ah amau a subuaita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia kumpipa Kura damlai tengteng, Persia kumpipa Darias lal lai tanpha in, a thiltup uh kalhse ding, amaute siatna ding in thuhilhmite a guai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahasueras vaihawm pattung lai in, Judah leh Jerusalem a tengte hekna lai a gelh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan Artaksarses damlai in Bislam, Mithredath, Tabeel leh a kithuahpihte’n Persia kumpipa Artaksarses kiang ah lai a gelh ua; laikhak gelhdan Suria laimal a gelh a, Suria pau a bawlkhiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dansiam Rehum leh Laigelhmi Shimsai in Jerusalem siatna ding in kumpipa Artaksarses kiang ah hichibang in laikhak a gelhta uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dansiam Rehum leh, Laigelhmi Shimsai leh, a kithuahpihte un huchi in a gelhta ua; Dinaimite, Apharsatkimite, Tarpemite, Apharmite, Arkimite, Babulonmite, Susanmite, Dehamite, Elammite leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sanappar lian leh thupi in a honpi khiak a, Samaria khopi leh luipi khen a gamdang leh a dangdang a kikoih namte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa Artaksarses kiang a a laikhak uh kopi tuh hiai ahi: “Luipi khenlam leh, a dangdang a na sikhate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kiang a kipan a hongtou Judahte Jerusalem ah kou kiang ah a hong uh chih kumpipa kiang ah theih in om hen: Khopi helhat leh hoihlou a lam lellel ua, a kulhbangte a zouta ua, a suangphumte a puahkhinta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa’n thei hen, hiai khopi lam a om a, a kulh bangte zoh a om leh zaw, leimante, siahte sumsinna leimante hiam lamlian leimante a pe kei ding ua, a tawptawp in kumpipa siatna ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin koute kumpi inn apan huhna ngahte ka hih ziak un, kumpipa zahlakna muh koute ding in a kilawm kei a, huaiziak in kumpipa thudik k’on khak uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na pipute chiamtehna laibu sung ah kizong hen: huchi in chiamtehna laibu sung ah na mu ding a, hiai khopi helhat, kumpipate leh bialte adia poikhoihhat chih leh, nidanglai mah in leng huai sung mah a helna a nabawlta uh na thei ding hi: huaiziak a hiai khopi kihihse gawp lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai khopi a kilam a, a kulhbangte hichibang a a kihihkhit lezaw, luipi khenlam ah tan na neikei ding chih kumpipa k’on theitel sak uhi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in dansiam Rehum leh, Laigelhmi Shimsai leh, Samaria leh, luipi khen a gam a teng a kithuahpih tengteng kiang ah kumpipa’n dawnna a khak: Chibai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Laikhak ka kiang a n’on khak uh ka ma ah teltak a sim ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in thu ka pia a, a kizong khin a, nidanglai in hiai khopi in kumpipate tung ah helna a bawl a, huai ah helpina leh helna a na kibawlta chih muhkhiak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huailou in kumpipa thilhihthei taktak, luipi khengam tengteng tung a vaihawm, Jerusalem tung a vaihawmte a na om ua; van leimante, sumsinna leimante leh, lamlian leimante amau kiang a piak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in keimah in thupiak ka bawl masiah, huai mite khawl ding leh, hiai khopi lam lou ding in, thupiak bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiai thu a ze awllou ding in pilvang un: bangding in kumpipate siatna ding in hoihlouhna a khang dia?” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi a kumpipa Artaksarses laikhak kopi Rehum leh, Laigelhmi Shimsai leh a kithuahpihte ma a a sim khit un, kintak in Jerusalem a Judate kiang ah a hoh ua, kihatsakna leh thilhihtheihna zang in amau a khawlsakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem a Pathian inn nasep a khawl a: Persia kumpipa Darias vaihawm kum nihna tan in a khawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan zawlneite, zawlnei Haggai leh, Zekariah Iddo tapa in Judah leh Jerusalem a om Judate kiang ah a thu a genkhol ua; a kiang uah Israel Pathian min in thu a genkhol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh, Jozadak tapa Jeshua a thou ua, Jerusalem a om Pathian inn a lam panta ua; amaute panpih in a kiang uah Pathian zawlneite a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchihlai mah in a kiang uah Tattenai, luipi khen a ukpipa leh Sethar boznai leh, a kithuahpihte uh a hong ua, a kiang uah hichibang in, Hiai inn lam ding leh hiai kulhbang zou ding in kuan thu a honpia a? a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiban ah ka kiang uah, “Hiai inlam mite min bang ahia?” chi in hong dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh Judah upate tung ah a Pathian uh mit a tu a, a thu Darias kiang a a hongtun a, huai tungtang laikhak a dawnna a hong kiknawn masiah, amaute a khawlsak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Laikhak kopi Tattenai, luipi khen a ukpipa leh, Sethar boznai leh, a kithuahpih Abharsa mite, luipi khen a omte’n kumpipa Darias a khak ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kiang ah laikhak a khak uh hichibang a gelh ahi; “Darias kumpipa kiang ah, Chibaibukna kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’n thei hen, Judia bial ah ka pai ua, suang thupite a lam, Pathian thupi inn ah, kulhbangte singte a kikoih a, hiai nasep thanopna toh a pai zel a, a khut uah ma a sawnzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai upate thu ka dong ua, hichibang in a kiang uah, Hiai inn lam ding leh hiai kulhbang zou ding in nou kuan thu a honpia a? ka chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang kiang a tel mahmah genthei ding in, a minte uh leng ka dong ua, huchi a amau makaipen a om mite min ka gelhkhiak theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in hichibang in kou a hon dawng uhi, Van leh lei Pathian sikhate ka hi ua, hiai inn kum tampi a na kilamsa, Israel kumpipa thupi in a lam leh a zohsa inn ka lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh ka pipute un van Pathian a na suk heh nung un, amaute Babulon kumpipa Nebukadnezzar, Kaldai mi khut ah a pia a, aman hiai inn a hihsia a, mite Babulon lam ah a pimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Babulon kumpipa Kura kum khatna kum in, kumpipa Kura in hiai Pathian inn lam ding in thupiak a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dangkaeng leh dangka tuium-belsuan Pathian in a leng, Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem a om Pathian inn a kipan a a lakkhiak a, Babulon biakin a laklutte, huaite kumpipa Kura in Babulon biakin a kipan a lakhia a, mi khat Sesbazzar, ukpipa dia a bawl kiang ah huaite a pekhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Hiai tuium-belsuan la inla, pai in, Jerusalem a om biakin ah koih in, a mun ah Pathian inn lam hi hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huailai in Sesbazzar a hong a, Jerusalem a om Pathian inn suangphumte a koih a: huai hun a kipan tutan in lam in a om gige a, hinapiin lah zoh ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin kumpipa’n hoih a sakleh, Babulon a om, kumpipa laigelhte koihchingna inn sung kizong henla, Jerusalem a hiai Pathian inn lam ding kumpipa Kura in thupiak bawlna hiam a bawl leh, hiai thu ah kumpipa’n a kipahna kou hon khak hen” chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchihlai in kumpipa Darias in thupiak a bawl a, Babulon a goute koihkhawmna, laibute in sung a zong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Akmetha ah, Media bial a om inpi ah laizial a kimu khia a huai ah chiamtehna ding in hichibang a gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kumpipa Kura kum khatna kum in, Kura kumpipa’n thupiak a bawl hi: Jerusalem a Pathian inn tungtang, a inlam hi henla, kithoihnate a latna mun uh leh, huai a suangphumte kiptak a koih hi hen; a sanlam tong sawmguk, a zatlam tong sawmguk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suang thupipi vual thum leh, sing thak vual khat toh: huan sumzatbei kumpipa inn a kipan a piakkhiak hi hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nebukadnezzar in Jerusalem biakin a kipan a a lakkhiak, Babulon lam a a lak, Pathian inn a dangkaeng leh dangka tuium-belsuan piak nawn vek hi henla, Jerusalem a om Pathian biakin sung ah amau mun chiat ah koihnawn vek hi hen. Kura in nasep sutzop ding thu a pia hi”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tattenai, luipi khen a ukpipa, Sethar boznai leh na kithuahpihte uh Apharsa mite, luipi khen a omte: huai inn lamna a kipan gamla ah om un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai Pathian inn nasepna subuai kei un; Judahte ukpipa leh Judahte upate’n a mun ah hiai Pathian inn lam uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huailou in hiai Pathian inn lamna ding a hiai Judah upate kiang ah na hih ding uh thu ka bawl hi: kumpipa vante a kipan, luipi khen a siah a kipan mahmah in, hiai mite kiang a sumzatnate thanopna chiteng toh a piak ding ahi, huchi a dal a a omlouhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan a taksapnate uh, bawngtalnoute, belamtalte, belamnoute, Van Pathian kiang a haltum thillat ding huitbuh, chi, uain leh thaute, Jerusalem a om siampute thu bangzel in, tatlaklou in niteng in amau piak ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi a van Pathian kiang a gimlim kithoihnate a lat theih ua, kumpipa hinna leh a tapate hinna adia a thum theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thupiak ka bawllai a, kuapeuh in hiai thu a suklamdan leh, a inn a kipan inkam dohkhiak hi henla, huai ah amah dopkang touh leh henden in om hen; hiaiziak in a inn ekvum a bawl hi hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai mah hihlamdang ding, Jerusalem a om hiai Pathian inn hihse ding a a khut uh kuansak ding kumpipate tengteng leh mite tengteng Pathian huailai a teng ding a a min omsakpa’n paithal vek hen. Kei, Darias in, thupiak ka bawlta; thanopna tengteng toh sepkhiak in om hen” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Tattenai, luipi khen a ukpipa, Sethar boznai leh a kithuahpihte un, kumpipa Darias in a sawl ziak in, thanopna tengteng toh huchibang in a semkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah upate’n zawlnei Haggai leh Iddo tapa Zekariah genkholhna pansan in inn a lam ua ma a sawnzel uhi. Israel Pathian thupiak dungzui leh Kura, Darias leh, Persia kumpipa Artaksarses thupiak dungzui in inn a lam ua a zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa Darias vaihawm kum gukna kum a om, Adar kha ni thumni in hiai inn zoh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Israel tate, siampute leh Levi mite leh, saltanna ta dangte’n, hiai Pathian inn latna nuamtak in a neita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai Pathian inn latna ah bawngtal za khat, belam tal za nih, belamnou za li a lan ua; Israel tengteng adia khelhna thillat ding in, keltal sawmlehnih, Israel namte zah dungzui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem a om, Pathian nasepna ading in, Mosi laibu a kigelh bang in, siampute a tanhawmna uah, Levi mite a mun tan uah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan saltanna tate’n a kha khatna a ni sawmlehli ni’n Paikan Ankuang a lui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siampute leh Levi mite lah a kisiangsak khawmvek ngal ua; avek un a siang uhi: huchi in saltanna tate ading leh, a unaute uh siampute ading leh, amau mah ading in, Paikan gan a gouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saltanna a kipan a hong paikhe nawn, Israel tate leh, Toupa , Israel Pathian zong ding a, gam a khovelmite buahna a kipan amau leh amau kihuikhe tuam tengteng in, a neta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nuamtakin ni sagih sung tanghou silngou sohlouh Ankuangluina a bawlta uhi: Toupa’n amaute nuam a sasakin, Israel Pathian, Pathian inn a nasepna khutte uh hatsak ding in amau lam ah Assuria kumpipa lungtang a kiheisakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai thilte nung in, Persia kumpipa Artaksarses vaihawmlai in, Seraiah tapa Ezra, Azariah tapa, Hilkiah tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sallum tapa, Zadok tapa, Ahitub tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amariah tapa, Azariah tapa, Meraioth tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zerahiah tapa, Uzzi tapa, Bukki tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahisua tapa, Phinehas tapa, Eleazar tapa, Aron siampulian tapa:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai Ezra Babulon a kipan a paitou a; amah Mosi Dan, Toupa Israel Pathian in a piak dan theisa ahi a: a tung a Toupa a Pathian khut a om dungzui in, a ngetna tengteng kumpipa’n a phalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan kumpipa Artaksarses kum sagih kum in, Jerusalem ah Israel tate lak a a khen, siampute lak a a khen, Levi mite, lasamite, kongkhak ngakmite leh Nithinim mite, a hohtou ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa kum sagih kum kha ngana in Jerusalem ah Ezra a hongpaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Babulon a kipan a kha khatna ni khat ni’n a kuantou pan a, a kha ngana a ni khat ni’n a Pathian khut hoih a tung a a om bangzel in, Jerusalem ah a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ezra bel Toupa dan zong ding, zui ding leh, Israel tua danthusehte leh vaihawmte sinsak ding in a lungtang a koih kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin kumpipa Artaksarses in siampu, Laigelhmi, Toupa thupiakte thugelhmi leh Israel kiang a a thusehte gelhmi Ezra kiang a a piak laikhak kopi hiai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Artaksarses, kumpipate kumpipa’n, siampu, van Pathian Dan gelhmi, buching leh huchibang zel in, Ezra kiang ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thupiak ka bawl hi, huchi a Israel a mite lak a amaute tengteng, ka gamsung a, a siampute uh leh Levi mite, amau utthu petmah a Jerusalem a pai ding a theihsakte, nang kiang ah pai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa leh a thudotmi sagihte’n, na khut a omna Pathian dan dungzui a, Judah leh Jerusalem tungtang thu kan ding a, nang a honsawl bang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tenna Jerusalem a om, Israel Pathian kiang a man neilou a kumpipa leh a thudot mite’n a piaksate uh dangka leh dangkaeng paw ding in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babulon bial tengteng a dangka leh dangkaeng na muh tengteng, mite leh siampute’n amau utthu a thillat, Jerusalem a om a Pathian uh in adia uttak a a lat tengteng u toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiziak in thanopna toh hiai sum in bawngtalte, belamtalte, belamnoute, na lei ding a, a anpiak thillatte uleh a dawn ding thillatte uh toh, huchi in Jerusalem a om na Pathian uh inn maitam tung ah huaite na lan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dangka leh dangkaeng omlai hih ding dan nang leh na unaute’n hoih na sak dandan uh, na Pathian uh deihlam bang in hih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na Pathian in a nasepna ding a tuium-belsuan k’on piak uh, Jerusalem Pathian ma ah pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na Pathian in ding a kiphamoh dangdangte, piakna ding na neih dingte, kumpipa sumin a kipan in pekhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kei, kumpipa kei Artaksarses mahmah in luipi khen a om sumkemmite tengteng kiang ah thupiak ka bawl hi, huchi a Ezra siampu, van Pathian dan Laigelhmi in nou a hon nget, thanuam tak a hihzel a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dangka talent za khat, huitbuh tehna za khat, uain bath za khat, sathau bath za khat leh a zah genlou in chi nangawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangpeuh van Pathian in thu a piak, van Pathian inn ading in hih in om zel hen; a ziak bel bangding in kumpipa leh a tapate gamsiatna ding in thangpaihna a om dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huailou in leng k’on chitaktak uh hi, siampute leh Levite, lasamite, kongkhak ngakmite, Nithinimmite hiam hiai Pathian inn sikhate lak a a kuakua tungtang ah, van leimante, sumsinna leimante hiam lamlian leimante amau liausak dan ahi kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan nang, Ezra, na khut a om na Pathian pilna zui in, thukhenmi leh vaihawmmi, tuipi khen a omte mite tengteng vaihawm ding in sep in; na Pathian Dante tengteng, huaite theiloute nou sinsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kuapeuh na Pathian Dan leh, kumpipa dan zuilou , sihna chiang hizong leh, thanuamtak in a tung ah vaihawmna bawl in om hen, ahihkeileh, khakmangna hiam, vankhakna hiam, suangkulh lutna tan in” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem a om Toupa inn kilawmsak ding a, kumpipa lungtang a hichibang a thil koih, i pipute Pathian, Toupa nuamsa in om hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa leh, a thudotmite leh, kumpipa vaihawm pih thilhihthei tengteng ma a ka tung a chitna hon pepa amah ahi. Huchi in ka tung a Toupa ka Pathian khut dungzui in hihhat in ka omta a, ka kiang a hoh ding in Israel a kipan mi kizen tungtuan ka kaikhawmta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hiaite a pipute uh inkawte lak a a lupente ahi ua, kumpipa Artaksarses vaihawm lai a kei hon zuite khangthusuina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phinehas tapate lak ah, Gershom: Ithamar tapate lak ah Daniel: David tapate lak ah, Hattush,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sekaniah tapate lak ah; Parosh tapate lak ah, Zekariah: amah toh pasalte khangthusuina a suikhawmte za khat leh sawmnga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pahath moab tapate lak ah, Eliho enai Zerahiah tapa; huan amah toh pasal za nihte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sekaniah tapate lak ah, Jahaziel tapa; amah toh pasal sawmngate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adin tapate lak ah, Ebed Jonathan tapa; amah toh pasal sawmngate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elam tapate lak ah, Jesaiah Athaliah tapa; amah toh pasal sawmsagihte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sephatiah tapate, Mikael tapa Zebadiah; amah toh pasal sawmgukte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab tapate lak ah, Obadiah Jehiel tapa; amah toh pasal za nih leh sawmlehgiatte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Selomith tapate lak ah, Josiphiah tapa; amah toh pasal za khat leh sawmgukte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebai tapate lak ah, Bebai tapa Zekariah; amah toh pasal sawmnih leh giatte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgad tapate lak ah, Hakkatan tapa Johanan; amah toh pasal za leh sawmte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikam tapate lak ah, a nanungpente; hiaite a min uh ahi, Eliphelet, Jeuel, Semaiah leh, amau toh pasal sawmgukte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvai tapate, Uthai leh Zabbud; amau toh pasal sawmsagihte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Ahava pha a luang luipi tan in amaute ka kaikhawm a; huai ah ni thum ka giak uhi: mite leh siampute ka en vialvial a, huai ah Levi tapate kuamah ka mu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan Eliezer, Semaiah, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zekariah, leh Mesullam, mi kizen tungtuante, sinsakmite Joiarib leh Elnathan leng ka thukhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kasiphia mun a Iddo hausapa kiang ah amau ka sawlkhia a; Iddo kiang ah leh, Kasiphia mun a a unaute Nithinimte kiang a a gen ding uh ka hilh a, i Pathian inn ua ding a nasemmi ei adia hon tonpih ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in i tung ua i Pathian khut hoih a om dungzui in pasal khat lunggelsiam, Mahli tapate lak a, Levi tapa, Israel tapa ei ding in Serebiah a tapate leh a unaute, sawmlehgiat toh a honpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hasabiah, amah toh Merari tapate lak a Jesaiah toh, a unaute leh a tapate uh, sawmnih toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nithinimte, David leh a vaihawmpihte’n Levi mite nasepna ding a a piakte uh, za nih leh sawmnih Nithinimte: avek un minkhumna ah a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in huai ah, Ahava lui ah, anngawl ka phuang a, huchi a ei ading leh i nau neute ading leh, i neih i lamte tengteng adia lampi tang amah lak a zong ding a i Pathian uh ma a ei leh ei i ki niamkhiak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lampi a melma dou ding a ei hon panpih dia kumpipa kiang a sepaih pawl leh sakol tungtuangmi nget lah ka zum ngal a: hoihna ding a, amah zongte tung ah i Pathian khut a om a; himahleh amah mangngilh tengteng siatna ding in a thilhihtheihna leh a thangpaihna a om hi, chi a, kumpipa kiang a thu i gentak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An i ngawl ua hiai ding in i Pathian ngen ngutngut ua: huchi in amah i ngenzou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huailai in siampute lak a pipente lak a sawmlehnih, Serebiah, Hasabiah, leh a kiang ua om a unaute uh lak a sawm ka seh khen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau ading in dangka leh dangkaeng leh, tuium belsuante, kumpipa leh a thuhilhmite leh, a vaihawmpihte’n Toupa inn a a latte uh huailai a om Israel tengteng puak ding in ka buk sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A khut sung mahmah uah dangka talent za guk leh sawmnga leh dangka tuium-belsuan talent za ka buk sak a; dangkaeng lak ah talent za;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dangkaeng noubem sawmnih, darik sang khat lak ah; dal hoih nawttet, dangkaeng bang a manpha bel nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan a kiang uah, “ Toupa adin na siangthou ua, tuium belsuante a siangthou uh; dangka leh dangkaeng Toupa , na pipute uh Pathian adia utthu a thillat ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa inn dantante, Jerusalem a siampute lak a lupente leh, Levi mite leh, Israel pipute inkaw vaihawmte ma a huaite na buk masiah uh, kiveng unla, amaute kem un” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in siampute leh Levi mite’n i Pathian inn ua Jerusalem a a puak ding un dangka leh dangkaeng leh, tuium-belsuan bukkhiakte a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huailai in Jerusalem lam a pai ding in, a kha khatna a ni sawmlehnih ni’n Ahava lui a kipan i pawtkhia ua: huan i Pathian khut i tung uah a om a, melma khut leh lampi a bukmi a kipan aman hon tankheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem i tung ua huai ah ni thum i om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ni li ni’n dangka leh dangkaeng leh tuium-belsuan i Pathian inn uah Uriah siampu tapa Meremoth khut ah buk in a om a; a kiang ah Phinehas tapa Eleazar a om; a kiang uah Jeshua tapa Jozabad leh, Binnui tapa Noadiah, Levi mite a om uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A zah leh a gikdan tengteng sim ahi a, huai hun in laibu a chiamteh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pimangna a kipan a hongpai, saltanna tate’n Israel Pathian kiang ah haltum thillatte, bawngtal sawmlehnih Israel tengteng ading in, belamtal sawmkua leh guk, belamnou sawmsagih leh sagih, keltal khelhna thillat ding in sawmlehnih a lan uhi: hiaite tengteng Toupa ading a haltum thillat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kumpipa thukhenmite kiang leh, tuipi khen a ukpipate kiang ah kumpipa thupiakte a pekhia ua: huchi in mite leh Pathian inn a panpih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi a hiai thilte hihkhit a a omlai in, vaihawmtute ka kiang ah a hongpai nai ua, “Israel mite leh, siampute leh Levi mite, gamte a mite a kipan amau leh amau a ki koihtuam kei ua, amaute kihhuainate, Kananmi, Hitmi, Perizmi, Jebusmi, Amonmi, Moabmi, Aigupta mi leh Amormite, dungzui in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amau ading leh a tapate uh ading in a tanute uh a la ua; huchi in chi siangthou gamte mite toh amau leh amau a kihelkhawmta hi: ahi, hiai tatlekna ah vaihawmtute khut leh vaihawmmite a pipen ahi uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi a hiai thil ka zak in, ka puansilh leh ka puanak ka botkek a, ka khamul ka botkhia a, lamdangsa in ka tusuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huailai in saltanna a amaute tatlekna ziak a, Israelte Pathian thute ziak a lau a ling michih ka kiang ah a hong kikhawm ua; nitaklam kithoih hun masiah lamdangsa in ka tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nitaklam kithoih hunlai in ka tunggikna apan ka thou a, ka puansilh leh ka puanak bohkeksa toh; ka khukdin a, Toupa ka Pathian lam ah ka khutte ka zakkhia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw ka Pathian, na kiang a daktou ding in ka zum in ka zakta hi, ka Pathian: ka thulimlouhnate uh ka lu tunglam uah a pung deuhdeuh a, ka mawhna un vante a sunta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pipute uh damlai hun a kipan tuni pha in nakpi’n ka mawhta ua; huchi in ka thulimlouhnate uh ziak in kou, ka kumpipate uh leh, ka siampute uh, gamte kumpipate khut ah, namsau ah, saltanna ah, lohna ah leh zahlakna ah, hiai ni bang in piakkhiak in ka omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan tuin sawtlou sung a din Toupa ka Pathian ua kipan in hehpihna honglang a, suakta ding a omlai dia nutsiat ding in leh, a Mun Siangthou a omkipna honpe ding in, huchi a ka Pathian un ka mitte uh a hon sukvak sak a, ka tanna ua halhna neukha a honpiak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikha lah ka hi ngal ua; huchipi in leng sikha ka hihna uah ka Pathian un a hon mangngilh kei a, himahleh Persia kumpipate mitmuh in chitna a honpia a, halhna honpe ding, ka Pathian uh inn dingsak ding leh, huai a siatna bawlpha ding leh, Judah leh Jerusalem a kulhbang honpe ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuin, Aw ka Pathian uh, hiai zoh in bang ka chi ding ua? Na thupiakte lah ka lehngatsanta ngal ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na sikha zawlneite zang in thu n’on pia a: ‘Luah ding a na paina uh, huai gam, gamte a mite nitna ziak a gam nin ahi. A kihhuainate un gam tawp khatlam a kipan khatlam tawp tan a hihdimna ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in na tanute uh a tapate uh kiang ah pe kei unla, a tanute uh leng na tapate uh ading in la sam kei un, a muanna uhiam a hauhsakna uhiam leng tangtawn in zong sam kei un: huchi a na hat ua, gam a a hoih na nek ua, tangtawn a na tate uh adia gouluah dia na nutsiat theihna ding un.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi a ka gamtat giloute uh ziak leh ka mawhna thupi mahmah ziak ua, ka tung ua hongtung tengteng zoh in, nang ka Pathian un ka thulimlouhnate uh gunzah sang a hon gawt tawmzaw a, a sibang omlai n’on piak mu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thupiakte bohse nawn in, kihhuaite hih mite toh kituak in ka om ding uam? Omlai ding omlou khop a, suakta ding himhim leng omlou khop a na bolgawp matan ka tung uah na heh nilouh dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Aw Toupa Israel Pathian, nang na diktat a; hiai ni bang a a suakta omlaite n’on nutsiat ziak in: ngai in, ka mawhna un na ma ah ka om uhi’; hiai ziak in lah kuamah na ma ah ading theikei ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi a Ezra kap a Pathian inn mai a leisatna a kinei a, a thum a, thupha a tawilai in, Israel a kipan pasal leh numei leh naupang tampi kikhawmte a kiang ah hong kikaikhawm ua: mite lah a nakkah mahmah ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elam tapate lak a khat, Jehiel tapa Sekaniah in a dawng a Ezra kiang ah, I Pathian tung ah i talekta ua, gammi numei namdangte i kitenpihta uh: hitamahleh hiai thil thu ah Israel ading in lametna a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin zite tengteng leh, amau a kipan a huchibang a piangte, ka toupa thuhilh dungzui in leh, i Pathian uh thupiak a lau a lingte thuhilh dungzui in, koihmang ding in i Pathian toh thu i khung ding uh; huan dan dungzui a hih hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thou in, a thu lah nang a ahi ngal a, kou leng na kiang ah ka om ding uhi: hangsantak in om inla, hih in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Ezra a thou a, hiai thu dungzui a a hih ding un, siampute leh Levi mite lak a pipente leh Israel tengteng a kichiamsak hi. Huchi in a kichiamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian inn mai a kipan Ezra a thoukhia a, Eliasib tapa Jehohanan dantan sung ah a lut a: huailai a hongpai lai in, tanghou a ne kei a, tui lah a dawn kei hi: saltanna a te tatlekna ziak in a sun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah leh Jerusalem teng a saltanna tate tengteng kiang ah thu a puangkhia ua, Jerusalem a ki kaikhawm vek ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kuapeuh ni thum sung a hong pailou, vaihawmte leh upate thu bangzel in, a van tengteng laksak ahi ding a, amah mah saltanna omkhawmte a kipan a tuamkoih ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchihlai in Judah leh Benjamin mi tengteng Jerusalem ah ni thum sung in a kikaikhawm ua; a kha kuan a ahi a, a kha ni sawmnih ni: huchi in mi tengteng Pathian inn mai a mun lian ah a tu ua, hiai thu leh vuahpi ziak in a ling uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in Ezra siampu ading a, a kiang uah, “Na talek ua, Israel mawhna khangsak ding in, numei namdangte na kitenpih uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin na pipute uh Pathian, Toupa kiang ah thupha tawi unla, a kipahlam hih un: gam a mite a kipan, numei namdangte a kipan kituam seh un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in kikhawmte tengteng in a dawng ua, aw ngaihtak in, “Ka tungtang uh na gen bang in, huchibang in ka hih ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh mite tampi ahi ua, vuah tampi zuklai ahi, huchi in inkuan ah ka ding theikei ua, hiai lah ni khat hiam nasep ahi kei hi: hiai thu ah lah nakpitak in i talekta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin omkhawmte ading in i vaihawmte ding seh in om henla, i Pathian uh thangpaihna ei a kipan a a kihei a, hiai thu hihbei a hih masiah, numei lamdangte kitenpihte i khopite a omte hun sehsate ah, khopi chiteng a upate amau toh, huailai a vaihawmmite toh, hongpai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asahel tapa Jonathan leh Tikvah tapa Jahaziah kia’n hiai thu a sel uh: huan Mesullam leh Sabbethai Levi mi in amaute a panpih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchibang in saltanna a kipan kiknawnte’n a hihta uhi. Siampu Ezra, a pipute uh inkawte dungzui a, pipute inkaw lak a lupen kuate hiam toh, leh a minte ua amaute tengteng, tuam sehkhiak in a om ua; huchi in a thu entel ding in a kha sawmna ni khat ni’n a tuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in a kha khatna a ni khat ni’n numei namdang kitenpih mite a hihkhin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in siampute tapate lak ah numei namdang kitenpih muh in a om a: huaite, Jeshua tapate, Jozadak tapa leh, a unaute, Maaseiah, Eliezer, Jarib leh Gedaliahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in a zite uh koihmang ding in pha a sa ua; a mawh ziak un, a mawhna ading in belamhon lak a belamtal a lanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Immer tapate lak ah; Hanani leh Zebadiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Harim tapate lak ah; Maaseiah, Elijah, Semaiah, Jehiel leh, Uzziah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pashur tapate lak ah; Elioenai, Maaseiah, Ishmael, Nethaneel, Jozabad leh Elasah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi mite lak ah; Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaiah, huai mah Kelita ahi, Pethahiah, Judah leh Eliezer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lasamite lak ah; Eliasib: huan kongkhak ngakmite lak ah; Sallum, Telem leh Uri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel lak ah: Parosh tapate lak ah; Ramiah, Izziah, Malkiah Mijamin, Eleazar leh, Malkijah leh Benaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elam tapate lak ah; Mattaniah, Zekariah, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremoth leh Eliah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zattu tapate lak ah: Elioenai, Eliasib, Mattaniah, Jeremoth, Zabad, leh Aziza.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bebai tapate lak ah; Jehohanan, Hananiah, Zabbai, Athlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bani tapate lak ah; Mesullam, Malluk, Adaiah, Jasub, Sheal leh Jeremoth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan Pahath moab tapate lak ah; Adna, Selal, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattaniah, Bezalel, Binnui, leh Manasseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Harim tapate lak ah; Eliezer, Ishijah, Malkiah, Semaiah, Simeon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamin, Malluk leh Semariah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hasum tapate lak ah; Mattenai, Mattattah, Zabad, Eliphelet, Jeremai, Manasseh, Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bani tapate lak ah; Maadai, Amram, leh Uel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Benaiah, Bedeiah, Kelluh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vaniah, Meremoth, Eliasib;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mattaniah, Mattenai, leh Jaasau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bani, Binnui, Shimei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Selemiah leh, Nathan leh, Adaiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Maknadebai, Shasai, Sharai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Azarel leh, Selemiah, Semariah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sallum, Amariah, Joseph.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nebo tapate lak ah; Jeiel, Mattithiah, Zabad, Zebina, Iddo, Joel leh Benaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hiai tengtengte’n namdang zite a pi ua: huchi in a lak ua khenkhatte’n hiai zite a kipan tate a nei uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
